Everything else works automatically.

BehaviorEvery roll increases the pity counter.
After soft pity (default 40), drop chances for rare items rise.
At hard pity (default 70) a Legendary (or higher) is guaranteed.
Getting a Legendary (or the rarity you set) resets the counter to 0.
Pity is saved per table and can be persisted with SavePity() / LoadPity().
